    homeLabel: "Home",
    sections: [
      {
        heading: "1. Overview of Technologies Used",
        body: "Real BMI uses a privacy-first web architecture. When you calculate your BMI, BMR, or caloric expenditure, all physiological numbers are processed entirely within your browser's local JavaScript runtime. We never transmit your health measurements to our servers. To deliver a smooth, high-performance experience and support free access, we utilize minimal browser local storage and third-party cookies as detailed below."
      },
      {
        heading: "2. Strictly Necessary Functional Storage",
        body: "These items are required for the website and calculators to operate correctly. They do not store personal identifiers and cannot be disabled in our preference center:"
